  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 293
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: '{xiaozi}没见过世面，这可是凡世的真龙天子。不过依老夫观察，这宁王身上龙气涣散，且被浊气侵蚀，怕是为了延长寿命练了什么{color=#d0380a}奇怪的功法{/color}，才落得如此模样。'
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 2
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114813844993716598
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1473796370109447}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 290
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你悄悄抬起头看向高坐堂上的宁王，此人形销骨立，面容枯槁，一身华服松松垮垮地挂在瘦削的躯体上，看起来格外滑稽。正在此时你恰巧对上他的目光，那一瞬间从他眼中露出的寒芒令你心生畏惧。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
